---
import ArchwayLayout from '../layouts/ArchwayLayout.astro';
import HeroComplianceBooking from '../components/compliance/HeroComplianceBooking.astro';
import ComplianceBody from '../components/compliance/ComplianceBody.astro';
import BottomCTA from '../components/shared/BottomCTA.astro';
---

<ArchwayLayout
  title="What Happens After a CSR Clicks a Phishing Email? | Archway"
  description="Book a 30-minute phishing review and find out what one stolen password would open at your agency, and what stops it."
  ctaText="Book My Phishing Review"
  ctaHref="#hero-form"
>
  <HeroComplianceBooking
    badge="Cybersecurity Awareness Month"
    formTitle="Book Your Phishing Review"
    headline="What Happens After a CSR <span class='hl'>Clicks the Wrong Email?</span>"
    subhead="Book a 30-minute phishing review and find out what one stolen password would open at your agency, and what stops it."
    formId="1b1111a8-5676-4e36-abaa-526149652cfa"
    submitText="Book My Phishing Review"
    showFallback={false}
  />
  <ComplianceBody
    bodyHtml="<p>The phishing email that gets into an agency rarely looks like a scam. It looks like a carrier asking you to confirm a portal login, a client sending a document to review, or Microsoft saying a mailbox is full.</p><p>It arrives at a busy moment, and your CSRs are paid to be responsive. Training helps, but it cannot be the only thing standing between that click and your client data.</p><p>In 30 minutes we look at what one stolen password would open at your agency today, and at the controls that decide whether a click is an inconvenience or an incident.</p>"
    bullets={[
      "The lures aimed at agencies, and why they work on good employees",
      "What one stolen password would open today",
      "Email filtering and impersonation protection",
      "Sign-in rules that stop a stolen password from being enough",
      "Staff training and simulated phishing",
      "What to do in the first hour after someone clicks"
    ]}
    authorityLine="Archway works exclusively with independent insurance agencies, on Applied Epic, AMS360, HawkSoft, EZLynx, and the other management systems agencies run on."
    whoThisIsFor="Agency owners and operations managers whose staff handle carrier portals, client documents, and a full inbox every day."
  />
  <BottomCTA
    heading="Find out what one click would reach."
    subtext="Thirty minutes by phone or video. We follow up within one business day to schedule it."
    ctaText="Book My Phishing Review"
    ctaHref="#hero-form"
  />
</ArchwayLayout>
